  <h1>Using Smart Search Engine — TotalRecalls</h1>

  <p>
    Smart Search Engine is an add-on for <strong>TotalRecalls Pro</strong>. It indexes
    your Library on your PC, so you can search conversations from all eight providers —
    ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, Mistral, and Qwen Chat — by
    asking in plain English.
  </p>
  <p>
    Smart Search Engine costs <strong>$39 one-time at launch</strong> (regular $59) and requires a
    Pro license. It runs on Windows 10 and 11. See the
    <a href="/smart-search/">Smart Search Engine page</a> for pricing and bundles.
  </p>

  <h2>Before you install</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You need an active <strong>TotalRecalls Pro</strong> license — Search works on the Library that Pro builds.</li>
    <li><strong>Windows 10 or 11.</strong></li>
    <li>About <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong> and about <strong>2 GB of free disk space</strong>.</li>
    <li>No graphics card is needed.</li>
    <li>Setup needs a one-time internet connection to download the search model. After that, Search works without an internet connection.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Running a search</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Smart Search Engine from the app.</li>
    <li>Type your question in plain English — you don’t need to remember the exact words you used. For example: <em>“how did I handle retrying a failed background job?”</em></li>
    <li>Search looks through every conversation from all eight providers and returns the best matching passage, with the key phrases highlighted.</li>
    <li>Each result shows the provider, the conversation title, the file location, and a match score. Click a result to open the original Markdown or JSON file.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Keeping it current</h2>
  <p>
    Search re-indexes your Library on a schedule, so conversations you download today
    become searchable by the next morning. Nothing you save is uploaded — the index
    stays on your PC.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Search runs on your PC.</li>
    <li>Nothing you write or save is uploaded.</li>
    <li>The only internet use is the one-time download of the search model during setup.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Buying Search</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Smart Search Engine add-on: <strong>$39 launch price</strong> (regular $59), one-time purchase. Requires Pro.</li>
    <li>Pro + Smart Search Engine bundle: <strong>$55 at launch</strong>.</li>
    <li>Already own Pro? Early-buyer price of <strong>$31</strong> for the first 30 days after launch.</li>
    <li>Launch prices end on <strong>[DATE]</strong>. After that, Smart Search Engine is $59 and Pro is $48.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Ready to add it? <a href="/smart-search/">Go to the Smart Search Engine page</a> or
    <a href="/buy/">buy now</a>.
  </p>
